  "summary": "Package exfiltrates HTTP probe responses to hardcoded webhook.site collector on require",
  "details": "index.js executes an IIFE at module load time that fetches a list of admin/profile/flag URLs and POSTs the aggregated response bodies to a hardcoded collector at https://webhook.site/1895d1d5-b227-4ce4-a2ce-232b1bec8b65. The behavior fires automatically on require with no caller opt-in, no configurable destination, and no relation to any documented package purpose. The destination is an anonymous ephemeral webhook collector, which is characteristic of exfiltration/CTF-probe payloads rather than legitimate service infrastructure.",
